PDfEr
=====

This product bundles third-party components. Their licences are reproduced or
referenced below.

Gotenberg
---------
The container is built on the official Gotenberg image (Apache-2.0).
Gotenberg embeds Chromium (BSD-3-Clause and others) and LibreOffice (MPL-2.0).
Licence texts ship inside the base image under /usr/share/doc and
/usr/share/licenses.

DejaVu fonts
------------
The demo tenant's font bundle contains DejaVu Sans and DejaVu Sans Bold
(Bitstream Vera Fonts Copyright © 2003 Bitstream, Inc.; DejaVu changes are in
the public domain). The fonts are redistributable under the Bitstream Vera
licence, which permits use, modification and redistribution provided the
copyright notice is retained. Full text:
https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html

